TI  - A Model-Based Solution to the Offline Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning Coordination Problem
PY  - 2024
T2  - Proceedings of the 23rd International Conference on Autonomous Agents and Multiagent Systems
T3  - AAMAS '24
SP  - 141
